### 6.2 Adding Statistics

The code chunk below creates a summary statistics table showing the minimum, maximum, and average monthly sales per product.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
report %>%
  group_by(Product) %>%
  summarise("Min" = min(Sales, na.rm = TRUE),
            "Max" = max(Sales, na.rm = TRUE),
            "Average" = mean(Sales, na.rm = TRUE)) %>%
  gt() %>%
  fmt_number(columns = 4,
             decimals = 2)
```

